00 GITREINS_MAX_INPUT_TOKENS=8M, AUGER_GATE_PYTEST_BUDGET=3000s on the gate-form venv. Direct gates re-executed verbatim before task create (4 pytest selectors green at 9725360). CI at the judged head: run 42792032470 success.", "capability_tags": ["python", "tests", "live-substrate"], "depends_on": [], "worker_status": "pending", "commit_hash": "97253601ea20175e5395c16bc12cecb49a18686d", "guard_result": "PASS", "ci_result": "GREEN", "worktree": null, "branch": null}
